  "aiContextParagraph": "Growing internal support has emerged within the Gerindra party for Sufmi Dasco Ahmad to serve as a vice-presidential candidate alongside Prabowo Subianto. Multiple regional chapters, including those in South Papua and Central Papua, have expressed their backing, highlighting his ability to build coalitions across various political parties. Beyond party ranks, some academics and observers have identified his professional political communication skills and long-standing dedication as strengths for a potential national leadership role. Despite this momentum, senior party officials have emphasized that all internal candidates are evaluated and that the definitive choice rests with Prabowo Subianto. The current discourse places him among a list of prominent figures frequently mentioned in internal discussions, alongside other party figures like Sugiono and Muzani. This development highlights ongoing internal party processes regarding future electoral partnerships in Indonesia.",
